BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 631.99 Td (This policy explains how to use company IT safely, so that client and company information stays) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 617.59 Td (protected. It applies to all employees, consultants and contractors who use Rahmqvist systems or) Tj ET
