BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 573.19 Td (2. Your account) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 61.00 554.79 Td (ï) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 74.00 554.79 Td (Multi-factor authentication \(MFA\) is required for every company system, from any location.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 61.00 538.39 Td (ï) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 74.00 538.39 Td (Passwords must be at least 14 characters; a passphrase of four or more words is recommended.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 61.00 521.99 Td (ï) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 74.00 521.99 Td (Never reuse your company password anywhere else. A password manager is provided for free.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 61.00 505.59 Td (ï) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 74.00 505.59 Td (Passwords do not expire. Change yours at once if you suspect anyone else knows it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 61.00 489.19 Td (ï) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 74.00 489.19 Td (Never share your account, and never let anyone else approve an MFA prompt for you.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 459.19 Td (3. Devices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 440.79 Td (Company laptops are encrypted and managed by IT. The screen locks automatically after five \(5\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 426.39 Td (minutes without activity; lock it yourself whenever you step away. Install updates within seven \(7\) days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 411.99 Td (of being prompted. Company devices are for you only and must not be used by family members or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 397.59 Td (friends. You may read company email on a personal phone, but only through the company's managed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 383.19 Td (apps.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 353.19 Td (4. Software and cloud services) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 334.79 Td (Install software only from the self-service catalogue. To request something that is not there, raise a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 320.39 Td (ticket with the IT Service Desk. Free trials of online services need IT's approval, because they often) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 305.99 Td (store data outside the EU. Company files must never be stored in personal cloud storage or personal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 291.59 Td (email.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 261.59 Td (5. AI tools) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 243.19 Td (Use only the approved enterprise AI tools listed on the intranet, including the Rahmqvist Assistant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 228.79 Td (Never paste confidential, client or personal data into public AI tools. You remain responsible for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 214.39 Td (checking anything an AI tool produces before you use or share it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 184.39 Td (6. Email and phishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 165.99 Td (Report suspicious emails with the Report Phishing button in your mail client. IT will never ask for your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 151.59 Td (password, by email, chat or phone. Never enter your credentials on a page you reached from a link in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 137.19 Td (an email; go to the service directly instead.) Tj ET
