BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 587.09 Td (8. Lost or stolen devices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 568.69 Td (Report a lost or stolen laptop or phone to the IT Service Desk within one \(1\) hour of noticing - the desk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 554.29 Td (is open around the clock. IT will lock and, if needed, wipe the device remotely. If it was stolen, also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 539.89 Td (report the theft to the police within 24 hours and add the reference number to the ticket.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 509.89 Td (9. USB drives and removable media) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 491.49 Td (USB storage devices are blocked on company laptops. Share files through company file storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 477.09 Td (instead. Keyboards, mice, headsets and screens work as normal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 447.09 Td (10. Working in public places) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 428.69 Td (Use a privacy screen on trains, planes and in cafÈs, and do not hold confidential calls where others can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 414.29 Td (listen. Use your phone's hotspot rather than public Wi-Fi when you work with confidential information.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 384.29 Td (11. Personal use and monitoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 365.89 Td (Limited personal use of company IT is allowed, as long as it does not affect your work, is legal and does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 351.49 Td (not put company information at risk. For security, system logs are kept for 90 days and may be reviewed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 337.09 Td (when investigating an incident. Breaking this policy may lead to disciplinary action.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 307.09 Td (Summary of the rules) Tj ET
