BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 755.89 Td (Frequently asked questions) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 737.49 Td (Q: I clicked a link in a phishing email. What should I do?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 723.09 Td (A: Disconnect from the network, then call the IT Service Desk straight away. If you entered your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 708.69 Td (password, change it from another device. Reporting quickly matters far more than having clicked.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 686.29 Td (Q: Can I use ChatGPT for work?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 671.89 Td (A: Only approved enterprise AI tools may be used, and public AI tools must never receive confidential,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 657.49 Td (client or personal data. Check the intranet for the approved list.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 635.09 Td (Q: I left my laptop on the train. Who do I call?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 620.69 Td (A: The IT Service Desk, within one hour - it is open 24/7. They will lock the laptop remotely.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 598.29 Td (Q: Can I copy files to my own USB stick?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 583.89 Td (A: No. USB storage is blocked on company laptops; use company file storage to share files.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 561.49 Td (Q: How often do I have to change my password?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 547.09 Td (A: Never on a schedule. Change it only if you think someone else may know it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 524.69 Td (Q: Can my partner use my work laptop to check something quickly?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 510.29 Td (A: No. Company devices are for your use only.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 478.29 Td (12. Questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 459.89 Td (Contact the IT Service Desk at servicedesk@rahmqvist.example, or on extension 4444 from any office) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 445.49 Td (phone.) Tj ET
